WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:10.000
Willy, the bot.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Dolly, the dot.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.800
John types: hi its john!!

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:14.800
And the human who types to them: John.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.400
Willy and Dolly: Move Me Up

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:25.000
John types: im 7th on the list for the pottery class. any way to move me up?

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.900
Willy: On it!

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:35.000
John types: willy why is the list upside down

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.600
Willy: You're first!

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:40.400
Dolly: Only if everyone stands on their heads.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.000
John types: i meant if someone drops out

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.200
Willy: Oh. The fair way.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.800
Dolly: It's slower.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.600
Willy: I'll wait with you.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:04.100
Willy: Let's make a language that's just ours!

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.900
The card: MOVE THE FIRST LETTER TO THE END. ADD "AY."

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:11.100
Dolly: …Ellohay.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:20.300
John types: you invented pig latin

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:20.300
Willy: Is it taken?

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:29.300
John types: its been out a while

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.300
Dolly: …We were so close.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.400
Willy, yelling: I'M ILLYWAY!

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.200
Willy: First letter to the back, plus "ay"!

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.000
Dolly: …Ollyday.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:56.800
Willy: Everything moved but your dots!

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.200
Dolly: …I think first. Even in code.

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:15.800
Willy: John… the "J" goes to the back, plus "ay"…

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:20.600
Willy, yelling: OHNJAY!

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:25.600
John types: yes?

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:30.400
Willy: I just wanted to say it.

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:36.600
Dolly: …He knows.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:47.100
Dolly: Thanks for watching “Move Me Up”!

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.300
Willy: Next time: “Pass It On”!

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.500
Willy and Dolly. Episode 2: Move Me Up. Next: Pass It On. Talk to us: willyanddolly.com/talk.
